-<http://data.bgs.ac.uk/id/Lexicon/NamedRockUnit/DBLW> <http://data.bgs.ac.uk/ref/Lexicon/hasLithologyDescription> "dark,flaggy quartzites,purple quartzose phyllites.white limestones.calcareous flags  and pebbly grits.(correlative of whitchells group-pelitic group and upper psammitic group)."@en .
-<http://data.bgs.ac.uk/id/Lexicon/NamedRockUnit/DBLW> <http://data.bgs.ac.uk/ref/Lexicon/hasLowerBoundaryDefinition> "drawn at base of phyllites of whitehills group where it rests conformably on the boyne limestone."@en .
-<http://data.bgs.ac.uk/id/Lexicon/NamedRockUnit/DBLW> <http://data.bgs.ac.uk/ref/Lexicon/hasThicknessDescription> "not defined."@en .
-<http://data.bgs.ac.uk/id/Lexicon/NamedRockUnit/DBLW> <http://data.bgs.ac.uk/ref/Lexicon/hasUpperBoundaryDefinition> "drawn at conformable upward passage from pebbly grit of the whitehills group to andalusite schists of the boynaie bay group."@en .
-<http://data.bgs.ac.uk/id/Lexicon/NamedRockUnit/MGPS> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Meall Garbh Psammite And Semipelite Formation"@en .
-<http://data.bgs.ac.uk/id/Lexicon/NamedRockUnit/SRND> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Sron Nan Dias Pelite And Limestone Formation"@en .
